    "description": "Title\n: Wards GEO-logic System Science Set Rocks Fossils Minerals Educational Kit\nBrand\n: Ward's Natural Science\nModel\n: GEO-logic System Topic Set\nColor\n: Multi\nDepartment\n: Science & Education\nCategory\n: Hard Goods\nDescription\n: Expand your science collection with this Wards GEO-logic System Topic Set lot of 5, featuring educational rock and fossil sets ideal for classroom or personal study. Each set includes a labeled box with assorted specimens, designed to illustrate key geological and paleontological concepts. The included topics are Cleavage, Fracture, and Parting; Life of the Paleozoic Era; Life of the Mesozoic Era; Plants & Animals of the Past, Part II; and Introduction to Micropaleontology. Sets contain specimens ranging from minerals and rocks to fossils in small vials or plastic trays, with specimen names printed inside the lid for easy identification. All items are clean and well-organized, with visible signs of use limited to minor scuffs or light marks on the boxes and occasional empty slots where a sample may be missing. This comprehensive collection offers a hands-on experience for students, educators, and enthusiasts looking to deepen their understanding of geology and paleontology. Note, some boxes may be incomplete.\nLaredo\nNotes\nLOCAL PICK-UP IS NOW AVAILABLE.\nPLEASE CONTACT CUSTOMER SERVICE TO SCHEDULE AN APPOINTMENT. YOU MUST MAKE AN APPOINTMENT FOR LOCAL PICK-UP ITEMS. LOCAL PICK-UP IS AVAILABLE MONDAY-FRIDAY 8am-4pm CST\nIF YOU HAVE ANY QUESTIONS PLEASE CONTACT OUR\nCUSTOMER SERVICE DEPARTMENT AT\n(726) 237-7616\nOR CLICK ON THE CUSTOMER SERVICE TAB IN SHOPGOODWILL.COM\nUsed Items Disclaimer\nThis is a pre-owned item and is being sold “AS IS ” If you have any questions concerning this item, feel free to contact us\nAll items (including new) are donated and may pick up dust/debris from warehouse – wash/clean before you wear/use\nWe describe our items to the best of our ability and try to incorporate as much research as possible with books and internet\nHowever, we are NOT experts in any field\nAll measurements for items are approximated\nGoodwill helps change lives\nthrough the power of work!\nThanks for shopping\nGoodwill Industries Of San Antonio!\nTerms of Sale\nOrders must be paid for within ten (10) days from the close of auction, unless other arrangements have been agreed upon.  All orders not paid within ten (10) days from the close of auction will be resold without further notice.",
